# LWC Jest unit tests — local only, never deployed to the org
**/__tests__/**
**/*.test.js

# Tooling / local artifacts
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# Quarantined per ADR-23: Agentforce not org-portable (2026-07-01)
# EmployeeCopilotPlanner is the stock SF Employee copilot, Active in mortagate-de - deploy cannot overwrite
force-app/main/default/genAiPlannerBundles/EmployeeCopilotPlanner*
force-app/main/default/bots/EmployeeCopilotPlanner*
# AiEvaluationDefinition is NOT Metadata-API deployable on this org family (loop #8, 2026-07-03).
# There is NO authorable "Version" XML sibling: the registry shows AiEvaluationDefinition has no
# child type, the CLI-generated canonical XML has no version element, yet BOTH `sf project deploy
# start` and `sf agent test create` fail with "There must be at least one evaluation definition
# version exist" / "No active AI evaluation version found". The eval *version* is a server-side row
# created only by the Testing API / Testing Center UI, not by metadata deploy. Keep the local
# meta.xml as source-of-truth for the spec but exclude it from deploy so one-command deploy stays
# green. The runnable artifact is specs/Veridact_Auditor_Copilot_v4-testSpec.yaml via
# `sf agent test run-eval --spec <yaml>` (WITHOUT --no-normalize; that flag breaks session-id
# interpolation -> HTTP 403 RBAC). In-org def Id 4KCgL00000058szWAA.
force-app/main/default/aiEvaluationDefinitions/Veridact_Auditor_Copilot_v4_RuntimeSelection*
